                    "value": "How to read it: HERA is a model forced by a reanalysis, not gauged flow, and 30 years of floods carry the years that happen to be in them. Flood days count against the EFAS 1-in-2-year flow, fitted on another model run: read them as a trend, not a count. Blank means the HERA layer has not been computed on this machine, never zero.",
